rs  a sequel will reunite boyega and cornish  the latter of whom is once again both  writing and directing  this time boyega will also be acting as  co-producer  in addition to reprising his role as  moses speaking to deadline boyega said  it's been a decade since attack the  block was released and so much has  changed since then  i'm excited to see this heightened story  return to the streets of london  moses has remained one of my favorite  characters to play and bringing him back  is a huge honor  cornish echoed his collaborators  enthusiasm saying  i'm thrilled we're officially announcing  our return to the world of attack the  block on the 10th anniversary  of the film's release i can't wait to  work alongside jon again  bringing audiences and even bigger slice  of inner city alien action  although the stephen king novel pet  cemetery has a pretty conclusive ending  the same cannot be said for the 2019  film adaptation  which reimagined the story in a much  more open-ended fashion  so it makes sense that pet cemetery 2 is  now in the works from paramount  which will be helmed by chaos walking  scribe lindsey beer in her directing  debut  the film is said to skip theaters  debuting exclusively on the paramount  plus streaming service  the 2019 remake of the 1989 original  starred jason clark  and amy simons as parents who discover a  small cemetery near their new house  after their cat is hit by a car and  killed they bury him in the cemetery  only for him to come back to life of  course everything goes downhill from  there  and in typical stephen king fashion  things get pretty disturbing pretty  quickly  plot details for the sequel are unknown  but given the ending of the first film  it seems almost certain that it will  feature a new cast  with the only returning character being  the pet cemetery itself  ahead of the release of spyral from the  book of saw the ninth installment in the  saw horror franchise  star chris rock was already campaigning  for a sequel speaking to radiotimes.com  rock said  i hope this movie is like creed and the  sense that creed is technically like  rocky 7.  so hopefully there's more spirals and  hopefully i'm in more spirals  we'll see if people like it we'll see if  people turn out  luckily people have indeed turned out  with spiral pushing the horror franchise  over the one billion dollar mark at the  global box office  by itself the numbers for spiral haven't  been particularly impressive  although it hasn't been a disastrous  showing by any measure especially  considering that it was released in the  midst of the kovid 19 pandemic  as such it was reported ahead of the  movie's release that lionsgate was  actively developing a 10th saw film  although this hasn't been confirmed by  the studio and although spiral director  daryn lynn bausman has warned fans not  to get ahead of themselves  he has admitted that a sequel isn't out  of the question he told radiotimes.com  i think that if spiral is successful  they'll continue it on  but if this has to be successful fans  have to embrace what this is  and if they do embrace it i think  they'll continue on as they have in the  past  the game is afoot again after the smash  success  of 2020s and now the homes netflix's  detective caper starring millie bobby  brown as a younger sister of sherlock  holmes the streamer has greenlit a  sequel  based on a series of novels by nancy  springer the first film saw the teenager  nola running away from home  to investigate her mother's mysterious  disappearance against the explicit  instructions of her older brother  mycroft who steps in as her guardian  during her journey she befriends a  viking chukesbury  a young runaway who's been targeted for  assassination of course by the end of  the film anola has solved both mysteries  as well as earn the respect of her  famous detective sibling  while the plot of the sequel isn't yet  known it will undoubtedly see another  taking on another case  although whether s